{"sections":[{"slug":"滤代数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"滤代数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">滤代数</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"滤代数"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">滤代数一般是指域</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/滤对象(1-范畴)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">滤</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">向量空间</span>\n$$\r\nF^\\bullet A = (0 = F^0A \\subset F^1A \\subset\\cdots\\subset A),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">配备相容的乘法</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即满足</span> $F^nA \\cdot F^mA \\subset F^{n+m}A$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">滤代数</span> $F^\\bullet A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/关联分次代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">关联分次代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Gr}A = \\bigoplus_n F^n A / F^{n-1} A.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $\\mathfrak{g}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/泛包络代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">泛包络代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $U\\mathfrak{g}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是滤代数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其关联分次代数同构于</span> $\\operatorname{Sym}\\mathfrak{g}$ (PBW <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>).</p>\n"}]}}}]}